251
00:16:32,640 --> 00:16:33,940
On items I wish to purchase.

252
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:37,100
Good day. Thank you.

253
00:16:40,960 --> 00:16:41,960
Mr.

254
00:16:42,160 --> 00:16:46,900
Young. Mr. Young, I'm very sorry to
disturb you. I'm sorry to disturb you,

255
