271
00:17:48,030 --> 00:17:53,110
But you have been so charmingly
persistent.

272
00:17:55,850 --> 00:17:58,770
Perhaps you and Mrs. Dale would care to
have dinner with me here at the hotel

273
00:17:58,770 --> 00:18:03,730
