275
00:18:05,410 --> 00:18:06,410
Six it shall be.

276
00:18:07,290 --> 00:18:08,290
Bye -bye.

277
00:19:11,439 --> 00:19:15,400
I'll be back momentarily. Be a good
brother and tidy up some of the better

