00:20:44,440 --> 00:20:45,820
Excuse me, Mr. Tremaine.

302
00:20:46,240 --> 00:20:47,119
Is Mr.

303
00:20:47,120 --> 00:20:48,120
Young in?

304
00:20:48,260 --> 00:20:52,200
I've got some wonderful things, I mean
antiques, that he should really take a

