323
00:21:47,440 --> 00:21:48,540
We want to see him.

324
00:21:48,940 --> 00:21:52,680
I want to speak to that so -called
antique dealer.

325
00:21:54,120 --> 00:21:58,320
Mr. Young is in sweet night. Felix King,
mind your business. Now, please, Mrs.

